This package adds an offline Android WebView shell, system-recorder delegation,
system file-picker integration and localized native guidance. It does not embed
a recording engine, speech model, cloud service, SDK/JDK, private signing key or
patient data. Android and WebView are device-provided components with their own
terms; build tool provenance and licenses are referenced in docs/BUILD-TOOLCHAIN.md.

Synthetic test fixtures are not clinical records. Clinical validation and real
device/OEM recorder verification remain pending. Medical references are not
endorsements or certification. User-entered records and external audio are not
